    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Agate",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Agate is a demon girl cursed with an eternal life. To forget the past, she throws half of her head into a deep valley and runs away. Unexpectedly, the tears flood the valley floor and form into a lake, triggering a flood in hell. Aloys, the Prince of Ghost comes to the Human World to find out the truth and finally finds the demon girl, starting a story of life and love.",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Brainless Witch",
        "Brainless Witch Agate",
        "Brainless Witch: Agate"
    ],
    "Modified": "2024-12-21",
    "Seasons": {
        "1": {
            "ID": "2072294",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/agate/seasons/official/1",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": null,
                "jpn": null,
                "por": null
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "The Valley of Hell has somehow been filled with water, and the overpressure of the water has squeezed through the rock formations, taking a heavy toll on the demonic clans that live in the underworld. Prince Alois dives to the bottom of the Hell Lake to investigate and discovers that the source of the disaster comes from the tears of half a witch's head. In order to bring the witch who threw the head to justice, Alois set off to the surface.\r\n\r\n(Source: Bilibili)",
                "jpn": null,
                "por": "O Vale do Inferno foi de alguma forma preenchido com água, e a pressão excessiva da água comprimiu-se pelas formações rochosas, causando um grande impacto nos clãs demoníacos que vivem no submundo. O Príncipe Alois mergulha no fundo do Lago do Inferno para investigar e descobre que a origem do desastre vem das lágrimas de meia cabeça de bruxa. Para levar a bruxa que atirou a cabeça à justiça, Alois partiu para a superfície"
            },
